{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-04-01 07:56:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL PLATTS LAUNCHES TANKER TCE ASSESSMENTS FOR EUROPE', 'text': 'LONDON, APRIL 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P GLOBAL PLATTS ("PLATTS"), THE LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF INFORMATION, ANALYTICS AND BENCHMARK PRICES FOR THE COMMODITIES AND ENERGY MARKETS, HAS LAUNCHED\xa0NEW DAILY TIME CHARTER EQUIVALENT (TCE) ASSESSMENTS ON FOUR KEY AFRAMAX ROUTES ORIGINATING IN EUROPE, EFFECTIVE APRIL 1, 2021. PETER NORFOLK, EDITORIAL DIRECTOR, GLOBAL SHIPPING & FREIGHT, S&P GLOBAL PLATTS SAID :\xa0"THE EUROPEAN TANKER MARKET HAS LACKED RELEVANT PRICING THAT REFLECTS THE MARKET FUNDAMENTALS OF NET DAILY REVENUES OF CRUDE VESSELS OPERATING ON THE KEY ROUTES IN THE REGION.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-04-01 04:30:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL PLATTS LAUNCHES FIRST DAILY HYDROGEN ASSESSMENTS FOR THE UK', 'text': 'LONDON, APRIL 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P GLOBAL PLATTS ("PLATTS"), THE LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF INFORMATION, ANALYTICS AND BENCHMARK PRICES FOR THE COMMODITIES AND ENERGY MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE FIRST SUITE OF HYDROGEN PRICE ASSESSMENTS FOR THE UK, EFFECTIVE APRIL 1, 2021. JEFFREY MCDONALD, HYDROGEN PRICING SPECIALIST AT S&P GLOBAL PLATTS, SAID: "WE ARE PLEASED TO STRENGTHEN OUR GLOBAL SUITE OF HYDROGEN PRICES WITH NEW UK HYDROGEN ASSESSMENTS, THAT ARE IN RESPONSE TO REQUESTS FROM MARKET PARTICIPANTS TO UNDERSTAND THE COST OF HYDROGEN PRODUCTION IN THE UK.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-04-01 07:56:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL PLATTS LAUNCHES TANKER TCE ASSESSMENTS FOR EUROPE', 'text': 'LONDON, APRIL 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P GLOBAL PLATTS ("PLATTS"), THE LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF INFORMATION, ANALYTICS AND BENCHMARK PRICES FOR THE COMMODITIES AND ENERGY MARKETS, HAS LAUNCHED\xa0NEW DAILY TIME CHARTER EQUIVALENT (TCE) ASSESSMENTS ON FOUR KEY AFRAMAX ROUTES ORIGINATING IN EUROPE, EFFECTIVE APRIL 1, 2021. PETER NORFOLK, EDITORIAL DIRECTOR, GLOBAL SHIPPING & FREIGHT, S&P